    "body": "We don't generally do telecons, and prefer public discussion like you're doing in this issue thread.\r\n\r\nThe best way to participate in the WHATWG process is outlined in https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features and https://whatwg.org/working-mode. In general, the more you can bring to the table as part of WHATWG issues, instead of linking to external documents that assume familiarity with another group's culture, the better.",
