    "created_at": "2020-08-06T16:31:41Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-06T16:31:41Z",
    "body": "> The best way to participate in the WHATWG process is outlined in https://whatwg.org/faq#adding-new-features and https://whatwg.org/working-mode. In general, the more you can bring to the table as part of WHATWG issues, instead of linking to external documents that assume familiarity with another group's culture, the better.\r\n\r\nOk, I'll try to write up a `<select>` explainer that goes into a github issue that outlines the gaps found in Open UI and in our explainer. My instinct is we'll want to break all of those up into separate issues - such as the `open` state but at least it will provide the cohesive use-case outlined and the known gaps.\r\n\r\ncc @dandclark @mfreed7 as FYI",
